    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to see it that way when i'm the reason they're always stressed. like, if i wasn't here, they wouldn't have to worry about my meds or my appointments or how i'm doing every single day. they could just... be happy. it feels like the most selfless thing i could ever do is just stop being a problem for them. doesn't it seem almost kinder to just let them be free of me?",
